    "Add a model key first: tap my picture, then Model." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请先添加模型密钥：轻点头像，再选择“模型”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add it to the tun inbound in your sing-box profile, then reload the profile." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将其添加到 sing-box 配置的 tun 入站中，然后重新加载配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add this URL as a remote MCP server in your client. Anyone with this link can control this iPhone while Poki is running. Keep it private, and revoke it here if compromised." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在客户端中将此地址添加为远程 MCP 服务器。Poki 运行期间，任何持有此地址的人都能控制此 iPhone。请妥善保管，如有泄露请在此处撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add your %@ key: tap my picture, then Model." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
