    },
    "Poki Runner did not start. In Settings → Developer, turn on UI Automation; in Settings → General → VPN & Device Management, trust the developer of Poki Runner." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki Runner 没有启动。请在“设置 › 开发者”中开启 UI 自动化，并在“设置 › 通用 › VPN 与设备管理”中信任 Poki Runner 的开发者。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki Runner is installed and trusted" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已安装并信任 Poki Runner"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki Runner is still running after Stop. Swipe it away in the app switcher; the banner goes with it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停止后 Poki Runner 仍在运行。请在 App 切换器中将它划掉，自动化横幅会随之消失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki Setup on your Mac renews Poki when this iPhone is connected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台 iPhone 连上 Mac 时，Poki Setup 会为 Poki 续签。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki Version" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki asks you before an agent pays, deletes, sends a message, places a call, types a password or does anything in Wallet: on the Live Activity, in a notification, or here in Poki. Turned off, agents do all of that without asking. Changes take effect the next time Poki opens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "代理付款、删除、发消息、打电话、输入密码或在钱包里操作之前，Poki 会先问你：在实时活动、通知或 Poki 里批准。关掉后，这些操作都不再询问。更改在下次打开 Poki 时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki can't reach this iPhone. Check in this order: Setup › Loopback (your proxy app or LocalDevVPN is connected, with 10.7.0.1 set), then Setup › Pairing (pair again with the loopback on), then Developer Mode in Settings → Privacy & Security." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 连不上这台 iPhone。请按顺序检查：“设置引导 › 回环”（代理 App 或 LocalDevVPN 已连接，并已设好 10.7.0.1），然后“设置引导 › 配对”（在回环开着时重新配对），最后是“设置 › 隐私与安全性”里的开发者模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki can't use the microphone. Allow it in Settings, Privacy, Microphone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 无法访问麦克风。请在“设置”›“隐私与安全性”›“麦克风”中开启权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki cannot access the keychain and has no relay key yet. Reinstall Poki with your signing tool, then reopen Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 无法访问钥匙串，因此尚无中转密钥。请使用签名工具重新安装 Poki，然后重新打开设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki can’t stay on in the background" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 无法在后台保持运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki could not reach %@: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法连接 %@：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki couldn’t read its relay key from the keychain (%@)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 无法从钥匙串读取中转密钥（%@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki has no default relay. Deploy your own to your Cloudflare account with deploy/cf-relay/deploy.sh from the Poki repository, then enter the address it prints. Screenshots and taps pass only through that relay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 没有默认中转。请用 Poki 仓库中的 deploy/cf-relay/deploy.sh 把中转部署到你自己的 Cloudflare 账户，再输入它输出的地址。截图和轻点只经过这个中转。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki is offline. Check that the phone has internet; Poki reconnects by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 已离线。请检查此 iPhone 的网络连接，Poki 会自动重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki keeps the key now; chatting with %@ comes in an update. Until then, choose Anthropic or OpenAI." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
